## 2. Module Responsibilities

### `database/`

| Module | Class / Function | Responsibility |
|--------|-----------------|----------------|
| `schema.py` | `DatabaseManager` | Thread-safe SQLite wrapper, WAL mode, FK enforcement, connection pool |
| `schema.py` | `SCHEMA_DDL` | Full CREATE TABLE / INDEX / seed DDL (v1 baseline) |
| `schema.py` | `get_db()` | Module-level singleton factory |
| `migrations.py` | `MigrationEngine` | Forward-only migration runner, version tracking |
| `migrations.py` | `MIGRATIONS` | Registry of (version, description, SQL) tuples |

### `ingestion/`

| Module | Class | Responsibility |
|--------|-------|----------------|
| `discovery.py` | `SourceDiscovery` | Auto-detect Steam/Xbox/NVIDIA/AMD + user paths; sync to DB |
| `dedup.py` | `DedupEngine` | Two-stage dedup: SHA-256 exact + pHash near-duplicate |
| `metadata.py` | `MetadataExtractor` | EXIF via Pillow, OS stat fallback, capture_source heuristic |
| `ingestor.py` | `ImageIngestor` | Per-file pipeline: already-indexed? → dedup → extract → upsert |
| `run_ingest.py` | `main()` | CLI entrypoint with banner, discovery, ingest loop, and report |

### `classification/`

| Module | Class | Responsibility |
|--------|-------|----------------|
| `base_classifier.py` | `BaseClassifier` | ABC defining `classify(path) → list[tuple[str, float]]` |
| `scene_classifier.py` | `SceneClassifier` | tiered backend: fine-tuned → ImageNet zero-shot → OpenCV → stub |
| `tag_manager.py` | `TagManager` | Tag vocabulary CRUD + image↔tag associations + bulk ML tagging |

### `query/`

| Module | Class | Responsibility |
|--------|-------|----------------|
| `api.py` | `QueryAPI` | High-level query interface; all methods return `ImageRecord` lists |
| `api.py` | `ImageRecord` | DTO: id, file_path, file_name, size, dims, source, timestamps, tags |

