## 3. Data Flow — Single File Ingestion

```
  File on disk
       │
       ▼
  ImageIngestor._process_one(path, source_id, stats)
       │
       ├─► Already in DB with same mtime? ──── YES ──► touch last_seen_at, return
       │
       ▼  NO
  DedupEngine.check(path)
       │
       ├─► SHA-256 in images.sha256? ────────── YES ──► exact_dupes++, return
       │
       ▼  NO
       ├─► pHash within Hamming 8? ──────────── YES ──► near_dupes++, is_duplicate=1
       │
       ▼
  MetadataExtractor.extract(path)
  (Pillow → EXIF, dimensions, format; OS stat → mtime, size; path heuristic → source)
       │
       ▼
  DatabaseManager.execute(INSERT OR REPLACE INTO images …)
  DedupEngine.register_phash(phash, image_id)
       │
       ├─► (optional) SceneClassifier.classify(path)
       │              TagManager.bulk_apply_ml_tags(image_id, predictions)
       │              INSERT INTO ml_results
       │
       ▼
  ProgressBus.emit_new / emit_dupe / emit_error
       │
       ▼  (Qt bridge)
  QtBatchWorker._on_event() ──► MonitorPanel Qt Slots (progress, new_image, etc.)
```

