## 6. ML Classification Pipeline

```
SceneClassifier.classify(path)
       │
       ├─ Backend == "torchvision_finetuned"
       │     └─ Load weights → ResNet-50 custom head → softmax → top-K STARFIELD_LABELS
       │
       ├─ Backend == "torchvision_imagenet"
       │     └─ ResNet-50 IMAGENET1K_V2 → top-5 ImageNet → _IMAGENET_HEURISTICS map
       │           → STARFIELD_LABELS with scaled confidence
       │
       ├─ Backend == "opencv_histogram"
       │     └─ HSV colour statistics → rule-based label assignment
       │
       └─ Backend == "stub"
             └─ [("unknown", 0.0)]
```

**Adding your own model:**
1. Subclass `BaseClassifier` in `classification/`.
2. Implement `classify(path) → list[tuple[str, float]]`.
3. Set `model_name` and `model_version`.
4. Pass your classifier instance to `QtBatchWorker(classifier=my_clf)`.

