## 7. Extension Points

| What to add | Where to hook |
|-------------|---------------|
| Custom ML model | Subclass `BaseClassifier`; pass to `QtBatchWorker` |
| Cloud sync | Wrap `DatabaseManager` with a sync layer; add `sources` type `cloud` |
| New image metadata field | Add column to `images` via `MIGRATIONS` entry; update `MetadataExtractor` |
| New query type | Add method to `QueryAPI`; call from any UI panel |
| Additional UI panel | Create `QWidget` subclass; add tab to `MissionControllerWidget._build_ui()` |
| Webhook / export | Subscribe to `ProgressBus`; emit on `EventType.COMPLETE` |

